    "ownership": "BrowserStack Software Private Limited / BrowserStack, Inc. Founded 2011 in Mumbai by Ritesh Arora and Nakul Aggarwal; North American HQ in San Francisco; corporate filings also in Dublin. The reviewed edition is the public Automate REST API at api.browserstack.com, not a mainland-China product.",
