      "searchCoverage": "Official BrowserStack Automate REST authentication (HTTP Basic username + access key), GET /automate/builds.json, GET /automate/builds/{build-id}/sessions.json, GET /automate/sessions/{session-id}.json, company identity (Mumbai/San Francisco/Dublin), dated incident search (BrowserStack + security breach/incident) reviewed on 2026-09-13. Historical 9 November 2014 Shellshock access to a subset of registered emails is recorded with the 2026-09-13 waiver. April 2026 Terence Eden canary-email spam report is recorded as unconfirmed. GHSA-fh4c-mffm-8xhf / CVE-2026-48723 is a patched browserstack-cypress-cli local RCE, not an api.browserstack.com customer-data compromise. This is not a breach-free claim.",
